 "title": "Scrolls Read by AI",
 "sentences": [
  "Scrolls burned by Vesuvius are being read for the first time, with help from AI.",
  "In the 1750s, diggers at a villa in Herculaneum found hundreds of charred papyrus rolls.",
  "They're too fragile to unroll, so researchers scan them with X-rays instead.",
  "In 2024, three students won a prize for using machine learning to spot the ink.",
  "They revealed more than two thousand Greek letters, about music, food and pleasure.",
  "In 2025, another team read a scroll's title: On Vices, by the philosopher Philodemus.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
